##   shockwave        the telegraphed burst a boss lets out as it changes phase
##   lifelink         {from_phase, pct}: heals this share of every hit it lands on a player
##   shield_wall_from_phase  frontal damage reduction from this phase on (see GameSettings)
##   saplings_on_phase       grows saplings when this phase begins
